    A001["<div class='arg'><b>A001 · VIEW</b><div class='core view'><span>The Fed's choice at the Sept FOMC is between a hike and risking a large bond spike.</span><b>[A]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Bond price action, including post Friday's CPI, shows the bond likes orthodoxy.</span><b>[A]</b></div><div class='c scn'><span><b>ALT:</b> <b>SC001 - Fed holds despite current pricing</b></span></div><div class='c scn'><span><b>ALT:</b> <b>SC002 - Fed hikes 25bp at September FOMC</b></span></div></div>"]
