    A005["<div class='arg'><b>A005 · PREDICTION</b><div class='core pred'><span>Warsh in the presser is more Warsh as at Jackson Hole than Warsh as at the July FOMC.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> <b>A004 - VIEW</b></span></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Warsh's Jackson Hole-style presser is largely to support the bond.</span><b>[H]</b></div></div>"]
