    A007["<div class='arg'><b>A007 · VIEW</b><div class='core view'><span>Warsh's hawkish hike supports higher front end rates and twist flattening of the UST curve.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c pred'><span><b>P:</b> <b>A006 - PREDICTION</b></span></div><div class='c view'><span><b>IM:</b> The hawkish hike challenges the author's prior bias for lower belly rates.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>IM:</b> <b>A008 - VIEW</b></span></div></div>"]
    A008["<div class='arg'><b>A008 · VIEW</b><div class='core view'><span>The hawkish hike supports the author's constructive long end asset swap spread view.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Lower growth and inflation risk supports UST investor confidence.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Enhanced Fed credibility supports UST investor confidence.</span><b>[H]</b></div></div>"]
    A009["<div class='arg'><b>A009 · PREDICTION</b><div class='core pred'><span>The Fed delivers an additional rate hike in October.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c sup'><span><b>CO:</b> Incoming data soften materially.</span><b>[HY]</b></div><div class='c sup'><span><b>CO:</b> Fed communication turns unexpectedly dovish.</span><b>[HY]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>CN:</b> Beyond next week's meeting, uncertainty around the policy path remains.</span><b>[A]</b></div><div class='c pred'><span><b>IM:</b> The Fed delivers an additional rate hike in December.</span><b>[H]</b></div></div>"]
