    A011["<div class='arg'><b>A011 · VIEW</b><div class='core view'><span>Part of the puzzle of the dollar being unable to rally amid the recent reacceleration in oil, gas, and refined energy products lies in the broader re-pricing of central banks and curves globally.</span><b>[A]</b></div></div>"]
    A012["<div class='arg'><b>A012 · VIEW</b><div class='core view'><span>The bar for the FOMC to #quot;out-hawk#quot; both expectations as well as other G10 central banks is high.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c fc'><span><b>IM:</b> The USD trades more-or-less sideways into year-end (ex-JPY).</span><b>[H]</b></div></div>"]
